destitute infirm, sick or incurable, or for the care and training of blind, deaf, music or otherwise disabled persons or of
handicapped and uncared for children;
(11)
The organisation, maintenance or management of maternity and infant welfare homes or centres;
(12)
The purchase and maintenance of dwelling houses for Corporation employees;

(13)
